rows.business_description:
Erika Sasson Consutling LLC works with clients on developing restorative responses to complex problems, including: 

(1) Direct facilitation for serious interpersonal harm, deep-end violence, and fatalities; 
(2) Working with non-profit organizations and companies trying to build a positive work culture and/or managing allegations of harm or conflict; 
(3) Working with community-based organizations designing responsive and effective restorative justice programming.
